{"name":"ロックブーケ","style":"ROMANCING SAGA 2 / ROCBOUQUET","family":"sword","height":94,"radius":17,"stats":{"weight":83,"walkSpeed":3.5,"initialDashSpeed":7.2,"runSpeed":6.8,"airSpeed":6,"airAcceleration":0.4,"gravity":0.58,"fullHopVelocity":13.5},"mask":"b>r*1.05&&b>green*1.05","customPreparation":true,"gate":"if(f.characterId==='rocbouquet'&&(type==='dash'&&RocbouquetRules.objects.some(q=>q.owner===f.id&&q.kind==='plasma'&&!q.dead)||['gale','airDrop'].includes(type)&&f.rocbouquetTemptCooldown>0))return false;","description":"通常必殺は溜めると二連になるウィンドカッター。横必殺は発射後に本人の現在位置へ戻る雷の刃。上必殺は長押し中に風の輪を上下左右へ操り、離すと輪から降りる。下必殺の誘惑は3秒間引き寄せ、通常の近接追撃ごとに1%回復。相手の頭上に残り時間を表示。"}
